    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Velocity from cross-sectional data is model-derived.", "Pubertal timing varies across populations and cohorts." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch03-08--gpt--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch03-08--gpt--dataset-2> .
